{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/6b932995f6dc8f02b3572b46248c6a0a.poster.avif?t=1764224470\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/6b932995f6dc8f02b3572b46248c6a0a.webm?t=1764224470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/6b932995f6dc8f02b3572b46248c6a0a.mp4?t=1764224470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape or Die trying!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash Dash Dead is a fast paced - turn based roguelite where you are given one last shot at your freedom! Fight your way through a randomly assembled game world, complete side quests for additional help and collect loot that changes the way you succeed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/0c0729d9b3a79bdb975c2db95476fd3f.poster.avif?t=1764224470\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/0c0729d9b3a79bdb975c2db95476fd3f.webm?t=1764224470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/0c0729d9b3a79bdb975c2db95476fd3f.mp4?t=1764224470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are at the heart of Dash Dash Dead - each item changes the game in some way and categories activate in different ways. Press a button to swap places with a random enemy, burn your foes over multiple turns, explosion upon death and over 80 more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air time is expensive, the more time you spend making your move, the harder the next room will be!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Quests move the narrative forward and unlock different bosses, while Side Quests help you succeed in different ways by providing new spawnable items, lore or other boons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new world tailored to your skills and core abilities in every single run. Handcrafted levels stitched together procedurally. Endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/0531fd156f5fc2ce534bc3978bc9dc26.poster.avif?t=1764224470\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/0531fd156f5fc2ce534bc3978bc9dc26.webm?t=1764224470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/extras/0531fd156f5fc2ce534bc3978bc9dc26.mp4?t=1764224470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The show must go on!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are only valuable to the prison if you generate revenue! As the show goes on, you need to fend for yourself and unlock as many helpful items as you can by completing side quests during your episode!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379780?t=1764224470","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379780/52d5c7969be06a18f06f3ccf0fab58eb3474f0f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764224470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst